<title>USA: Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 63.50-64.50, load reputation fed 65.00. Select 61.00-63.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to Choice 2-4 950-1250 lbs 63.00-64.50, reputation fed 64.75. Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
